	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_060ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance was on the throne, in a'
	R
	'very bad mood.'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_05fc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Ch...'
	R
	'That didn’t go so great.'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_06037:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_05fc7:
	ZH 1:
	'...What, Maris?'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_06037:
	ZH 1:
	'Nothing...'
	\L_060ec:
	ZH 1:
	'As a mere attendant, I have no'
	R
	'place to comment on your'
	R
	'choices.'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_05fc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Aaaaaaah, I hate when you do'
	R
	'that! I can object if you'
	R
	'blame me, but if you act like'
	R
	'that I can’t do anything!!'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_06037:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s why I was staying quiet.'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
