	ZH 1:
	'Alright, let’s conquer that'
	R
	'oasis city in the middle of'
	R
	'the desert.'
	\L_060ec:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s in the middle of the'
	R
	'world. That’s a really good'
	R
	'spot. It’d be easy to attack'
	R
	'Helman and Zeth from there.'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_06037:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s impossible, King Rance.'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_05fc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Why?'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_06037:
	ZH 1:
	'Shangri-La is surrounded by a'
	R
	'large desert. We would have to'
	R
	'pass through that desert to'
	R
	'get there.'
	\L_060ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Without any guidance, it’s not'
	R
	'really possible to cross.'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_05fc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Isn’t there trade with'
	R
	'Shangri-La, though?'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_06037:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes.'
	R
	'For that, desert guides from'
	R
	'Shangri-La lead the traders'
	R
	'directly there.'
	\L_060ec:
	ZH 1:
	'In the past, Shangri-La was'
	R
	'famous for its oasis and'
	R
	'beauty, so armies were sent to'
	R
	'attack it, but...'
	\L_060ec:
	ZH 1:
	'They all failed.'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_05fc7:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_06037:
	ZH 1:
	'What will you do?'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_05fc7:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmmm, hearing it’s impossible'
	R
	'just makes me want to try.'
	R
	'How about just attacking them'
	R
	'once? As a test...'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_06037:
	ZH 1:
	'Do you intend to sacrifice the'
	R
	'lives of hundreds of soldiers'
	R
	'on a test?'
	\L_060ec:
	\L_060df:
	\L_05fc7:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_060ec:
